#: plans/templates/plans/_day.html:29
msgid ""
"Pick one of your questions from this week. Find out the answer together "
"(book, encyclopedia, asking someone). What did you discover?"
msgstr ""
"Such dir eine deiner Fragen von dieser Woche aus. Findet die Antwort "
"zusammen heraus (Buch, Lexikon, jemanden fragen). Was habt ihr entdeckt?"

#: plans/templates/plans/_day.html:32
