"Waiting for the analysis server. The plan will be written automatically as "
"soon as it is switched on. You can close this page and come back later."
msgstr ""
"Warten auf den Analyse-Server. Der Plan wird automatisch erstellt, sobald er"
" eingeschaltet ist. Sie können diese Seite schließen und später "
"wiederkommen."

# | msgid ""
# | "The worksheets are being analysed. This can take a few minutes; the page "
# | "updates itself."
